---
title: PBXware Call Flow Builder — how a flow is composed and where it goes
---
flowchart TB

    start([New project]) --> name[/Name the project/]

    name --> way{How do you<br/>want to start?}

    way -->|From scratch| drag[Drag objects from<br/>the toolbox]
    way -->|From data| imp[Drop a CSV in the<br/>Upload panel]
    way -->|Carry on| open[Open a saved<br/>.json project]
    way -->|Look around| samp[Load the<br/>sample flow]

    subgraph compose [Compose on the canvas]
        direction TB
        drag --> place[Place DIDs, IVRs, groups,<br/>queues, ERGs, endpoints]
        place --> wire[Drag a port dot onto<br/>a node to route it]
        wire --> guard{Legal<br/>destination?}
        guard -->|No| refuse[Refused. An agent is only<br/>ever reached from a queue]
        refuse --> wire
        guard -->|Yes| ot[Optional: put an<br/>Operation Times gate on it]
    end

    imp --> vet{Vetted on import}
    vet -->|Target missing| pend[Kept as pending.<br/>Wires itself when built]
    vet -->|Wrong type| drop[Route dropped<br/>and reported]
    vet -->|Good| place
    pend --> place
    drop --> place

    open --> place
    samp --> place

    ot --> doc[(One document<br/>DOC)]

    doc --> check{{Findings run on<br/>every change}}
    check -->|IVR with no timeout| fix[Fix in the Inspector]
    check -->|Destination not built| fix
    check -->|Loop, or nothing reaches it| fix
    check -->|Nodes overlapping| tidy[Tidy these]
    fix --> doc
    tidy --> doc

    check -->|Clean| out

    subgraph out [Take it out of the tool]
        direction LR
        json[Save .json<br/>the project itself]
        wb[Export .xlsx<br/>11 sheets, export layout]
        png[Canvas .png<br/>per DID or whole flow]
        tpl[Consolidated template<br/>to hand to provisioning]
    end

    wb --> mapper[[Call Flow Map Creator]]
    mapper --> traced[Traced call map]
    traced --> deliver[PDF · SVG · Visio<br/>for the customer or Confluence]

    png --> deliver
    json -.->|reopen later| open

    classDef entry fill:#e4f5f7,stroke:#17a2b8,color:#0e5c68
    classDef menu fill:#eafaf0,stroke:#27ae60,color:#1c5c3a
    classDef queue fill:#eceff4,stroke:#607d8b,color:#37474f
    classDef warn fill:#fff4e0,stroke:#e0a800,color:#8a6300
    classDef bad fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#c0392b
    classDef good fill:#eafaf0,stroke:#27ae60,color:#1c5c3a
    classDef store fill:#f3ecfa,stroke:#8e44ad,color:#6c3483

    class start,name,way entry
    class drag,place,wire,ot,samp,open menu
    class imp,vet,pend queue
    class check,fix,tidy warn
    class refuse,drop bad
    class doc store
    class json,wb,png,tpl,mapper,traced,deliver good
